title: Clara Bünger
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, beweli
card-image: img/_portraits/BuengerClara.jpg
view-if: buenger_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Clara Bünger

Bünger is a jurist and immigration activist belonging the the Movement Left.

Fame: [+ buenger_advisor_fame +]
Passive effect: Antirassismus

- @promigration
- @migration
- @interior
- @root: Return to main
  
@promigration
title: Campaign for migration
subtitle: Fight against the right's racist propaganda.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; issue_migration -= 0.5*(buenger_advisor_fame/100); buenger_advisor_fame += 2; oldleft_dissent += 2 if oldleft_leader = "Wagenknecht"; rural_linke -= 0.5; east_linke -= 0.5;

We have started a campaign for migrant rights and better asylum processes. Hopefully we'll reduce the people's negative perception of immigrants.

@migration
title: Migration Affairs
subtitle: We can set our migration policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and interior_minister_party = "LINKE"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if interior_minister_party != "LINKE" : We do not control the Interior Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; buenger_advisor_fame += 2;

@interior
title: Interior Policy
subtitle: We can set our interior policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and interior_minister_party = "LINKE"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if interior_minister_party != "LINKE" : We do not control the Interior Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; buenger_advisor_fame += 2;
go-to: police
